        "structuredContent": {
          "content": "{\"sha\":\"db9838371a1128124b77fac69677902a4b5820c6\",\"node_id\":\"C_kwDOVIqlR9oAKGRiOTgzODM3MWExMTI4MTI0Yjc3ZmFjNjk2Nzc5MDJhNGI1ODIwYzY\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/guarani-ux/SAMSARA/git/commits/db9838371a1128124b77fac69677902a4b5820c6\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/guarani-ux/SAMSARA/commit/db9838371a1128124b77fac69677902a4b5820c6\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"guarani-ux\",\"email\":\"flowersnelsone@gmail.com\",\"date\":\"2026-10-15T04:25:48Z\"},\"committer\":{\"name\":\"guarani-ux\",\"email\":\"flowersnelsone@gmail.com\",\"date\":\"2026-10-15T04:25:48Z\"},\"tree\":{\"sha\":\"5eb2685e998f4ba6307361bce4dbeaffdc884e46\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/guarani-ux/SAMSARA/git/trees/5eb2685e998f4ba6307361bce4dbeaffdc884e46\"},\"message\":\"Add six task-driven workflows for Sciel's Samsara crew\\n\\nImplement delivery (full or selected service), research/preparation, exploration, guided learning, council/review, and revision/recovery routes. Each defines entry, ownership, equipment, inputs, transition gates, returns, and failure handling. Reuse Domain of Practice, Grimoire resources, and the existing work-record schema; preserve one outcome owner and optional crew recruitment.\\n\\nAdd a read-only list/show/check catalogue tool, 25 fixture tests plus an actual-checkout catalogue test, and explicitly unrun behavioral qualification cases. Wire routes into README, AGENTS, crew registry, and continuity guidance. No new agents, runtime, task store, source-package changes, or main merge.\\n\\nLocal fixture tests: 25 passed. Inherited suites and actual-checkout validation await this commit's GitHub Actions evidence. Historical qualification is not relabeled.\",\"parents\":[{\"sha\":\"4d30925ffad7d8072c4023871be18118b0ed79fd\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/guarani-ux/SAMSARA/git/commits/4d30925ffad7d8072c4023871be18118b0ed79fd\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/guarani-ux/SAMSARA/commit/4d30925ffad7d8072c4023871be18118b0ed79f